<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Geographic Analytics</h1>
<p>UTMPro uses MaxMind's GeoIP database to identify the country, city, region, and continent of every click.</p>

<h2>Click Map</h2>
<p>The Analytics dashboard shows a visual <strong>click map</strong> with country flags and bar charts showing click distribution by country.</p>

<h2>Geo Targeting</h2>
<p>Use geographic data to route visitors to localized landing pages:</p>
<ul><li>US visitors → English landing page</li><li>Germany visitors → German landing page</li><li>Japan visitors → Japanese landing page</li></ul>
<p>Set up geo targeting rules in the link's <strong>Targeting Rules</strong> section.</p>

<h2>Use Cases for Paid Traffic</h2>
<ul><li>Verify your ads are reaching the correct geographic markets</li><li>Identify unexpected traffic from non-target countries (potential click fraud)</li><li>Optimize ad spend by focusing on high-converting regions</li></ul>
